00:21:08.940 --> 00:21:11.060
And I looked it up and it's a real thing.

532
00:21:11.260 --> 00:21:14.600
It's a real sort of theory within business, the Peter Principle.

533
00:21:14.820 --> 00:21:21.540
It's this paradoxical idea that competent employees will continue to be promoted, but at some point

534
00:21:21.540 --> 00:21:25.560
will be promoted into positions for which they are, in fact, incompetent.

535
00:21:25.680 --> 00:21:29.440
